      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Every summer, Lake Arrowhead hosts a free concert series, the county’s largest Oktoberfest, and events like car shows and the Antique Wooden Boat Show.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lake_Arrowhead%2C_California",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The 1927 film Sunrise: A Song of Two Humans shot its exterior scenes in Lake Arrowhead, earning the movie three Academy Awards in 1929.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
