      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lake_Arrowhead%2C_California",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Lake Arrowhead’s history includes a 1904 logging railroad that hauled logs to a mill at Fredalba, later dismantled and hauled by wagon up the mountain.",
